From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:14:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1382/3799] soh: rename D_80B01EA0 -> sTalkRequested

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the in-tree comment on its declaration reads "gets set if ACTOR_FLAG_TALK is set"; three states assign Actor_ProcessTalkRequest's result to it and the rest read it to see whether the player started a conversation this frame.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c | 23 ++++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c
